                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ef852d0-d811-3de7-a84b-e56f51682a45",
                                        "entry_id": "3dc15634-e9a9-3a70-9e95-2eb0a31f0817",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of the Gordian knot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c94c291-891d-3961-afca-7c658842c007",
                                        "entry_id": "3dc15634-e9a9-3a70-9e95-2eb0a31f0817",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Twisted; convoluted; tied as a knot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45581e4d-5717-4de0-a09d-dea04ef6e0f2",
                                                "sense_id": "9c94c291-891d-3961-afca-7c658842c007",
                                                "text": "[…] cloſe the Serpent ſly,\nInſinuating, wove with Gordian twine\nHis braided train, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faec32cb-c167-4f16-bafd-25f839fd7d34",
                                                "sense_id": "9c94c291-891d-3961-afca-7c658842c007",
                                                "text": "[…] he found a palpitating snake, / Bright, and cirque-couchant in a dusky brake. / She was a gordian shape of dazzling hue, / Vermilion-spotted, golden, green, and blue; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee299a89-bfe6-444d-9270-d536aa1744fa",
                                                "sense_id": "9c94c291-891d-3961-afca-7c658842c007",
                                                "text": "When you put it that way it was so simple, so self-explanatory, so beautiful, so obvious that what had seemed the most Gordian problem was instantly almost mundane, and its elegance was its own proof."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
